The dataset configurations no longer accept settings that do nothing. An unknown or misspelled field of `TabularConfig`, `BIDSConfig` or `EmbeddingConfig` is an error; they were ignored. `subjects` belongs to `BIDSConfig` (subject labels) and `EmbeddingConfig` only: a table has no subjects, and `TabularConfig` ignored it. `select_kwargs` is removed from `TabularConfig` and `TabularDataset`, which never read it. With `columns_to_dims`, a column that does not split into one part per dimension is an error naming it; it was logged and dropped from the data, and metadata columns belong in `meta_columns`.
